recover <math id="S5.T4.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>+</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+</annotation></semantics></math>1.3 (Claude) and <math id="S5.T4.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>+</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+</annotation></semantics></math>1.8 (Gemini) points consistently across all three
bucket variants.</figcaption>
</figure>
